Subject: [PATCH 28/29] There is no race condition any more

To recap, previously, the Garbage Collector had a race condition:

> Path 2:
> - GC/0 List(SecretList, [map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true]]) -> list=&PartialObjectMetadataList{Items: [&PartialObjectMetadata{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 1, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true], }, ]}, error=<nil>
> - Actor/0 Create(&ManagedResource{Namespace: default, Name: mr, Annotations: map[reference.resources.gardener.cloud/secret-ccbd158d:secret-e3b0c442], }, []) -> object=&ManagedResource{Namespace: default, Name: mr, ResourceVersion: 1, Annotations: map[reference.resources.gardener.cloud/secret-ccbd158d:secret-e3b0c442], }, error=<nil>
> - Actor/1 Get(default/secret-e3b0c442, []) -> object=&Secret{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 1, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true], Immutable: true, }, error=<nil>
> - GC/1 Delete(&Secret{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, }, []) -> error=<nil>
>   assertion error: a (concurrently) referenced secret was deleted by the Garbage Collector

If there was an unreferenced secret in the system, and an actor concurrently
reconciled a managed resource which referenced that secret, the API calls could
be interleaved in a way that the Garbage Collector would delete the secret, and
neither the actor nor the Garbage Collector would notice this as an error, hence
leaving the system in an inconsistent state (the secret was deleted, but the
managed resource would still reference it) indefinitely.

With this PR, the Garbage Collector is now more elaborate and the unit test
shows that in every combination of the interleaved API calls the secret exists
at the end.

> Path 6:
> - GC/0 List(SecretList, [map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true]]) -> list=&PartialObjectMetadataList{Items: [&PartialObjectMetadata{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 1, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true resources.gardener.cloud/used:true], }, ]}, error=<nil>
> - GC/1 Patch(&PartialObjectMetadata{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 1, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true resources.gardener.cloud/unused_at:2000-05-05T03:30:30Z resources.gardener.cloud/used:false], }, Patch{application/strategic-merge-patch+json, {"metadata":{"labels":{"resources.gardener.cloud/unused_at":"2000-05-05T03:30:30Z","resources.gardener.cloud/used":"false"},"resourceVersion":"1"}}}, []) -> object=&PartialObjectMetadata{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 2, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true resources.gardener.cloud/unused_at:2000-05-05T03:30:30Z resources.gardener.cloud/used:false], }, error=<nil>
