> - GC/4 List(SecretList, [map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true]]) -> list=&PartialObjectMetadataList{Items: [&PartialObjectMetadata{Namespace: default, Name: secret-e3b0c442, ResourceVersion: 3, Labels: map[resources.gardener.cloud/garbage-collectable-reference:true resources.gardener.cloud/used:true], }, ]}, error=<nil>
>   assertion error: <nil>

Path 6 shows an API call ordering where the Garbage Collector previously deleted
the secret. Now the delete operation will fail with the following error and the
secret is not deleted silently. The next run of the Garbage Collector will
observe that the secret is referenced and will succeed.

> error=Operation cannot be fulfilled on secrets "secret-e3b0c442":
>   the ResourceVersion in the precondition (2) does not match the ResourceVersion in record (3).
>   The object might have been modified

